 "said": {
  "text": "AmberX plugin that records all audio the phone outputs while it is on, saved to the server on axHub. One switch + quick-settings tile. Playback capture only, NEVER the microphone. Android 10+; system consent prompt each start and a notification while recording. Calls and opt-out apps (DRM) cannot be captured. 30-minute timestamped chunks, each uploaded to axHub; keep the local file until axHub confirms, queue and retry when offline, small local cap. Built on the capture engine from claude/audio-extract (PR #187).",
  "verbatim": false,
  "at": "2026-10-30T00:00:00Z",
